    "html": "<h2 id=\"connectionTitle\">Review your front desk connections</h2><p>Review only the services listed below. After approval, we continue their setup in the background. Other selected services wait for their own available review.</p><h3>Your front desk number</h3><p>$0.00 one-time and $1.15 per month.</p><p>I authorize this synthetic number and its disclosed recurring cost.</p><h3>Phone answering</h3><p>Synthetic phone usage terms; no real call is made.</p><p>I approve the reviewed routing and usage.</p><p>Up to 3 calls and 15 minutes per day, with a 300-second call limit.</p><label class=\"form-label\">Customers reach your front desk<select class=\"form-input\" name=\"forwardingMode\"><option value=\"forward_business_line\" disabled=\"\">Through my existing business number</option><option value=\"use_new_number\" selected=\"\">On the new front desk number</option></select></label><p>To forward an existing line, first save a business number that is different from your contact cell. You can use a new front desk number without forwarding your existing line.</p><button type=\"button\" class=\"connection-guide-link\" data-connection=\"review_phone_details\">Add or review phone details</button><label style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;margin:16px 0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"costs\" required=\"\"><span>I accept the costs and usage terms shown for the services in this review.</span></label><label style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;margin:16px 0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"authority\" required=\"\"><span>I authorize Machines &amp; Cloud to reserve my dedicated front desk number and set up only the services listed in this review.</span></label><p id=\"connectionDialogMessage\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p><div class=\"walkthrough-actions\"><button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn-pill btn-pill-blue btn-sm\">Approve and start setup</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn-pill btn-pill-dark btn-sm\" id=\"connectionBack\">Back</button></div>",
